{"id":"932887ca-c844-4643-8e46-d80bbd0ccf34","slug":"ghost-soldier-trailer-out-jim-caviezel","title":"Ghost Soldier Trailer Out: Jim Caviezel","excerpt":"Official trailer for Ghost Soldier — premieres Nov 11, 2026.","body":"<div class=\"key-takeaways\"><ul><li>The trailer for <b>Ghost Soldier</b> dropped October 14, 2026.</li><li>New movie premiering Nov 11, 2026 on Sony Pictures.</li><li>Jim Caviezel stars as Henry 'Fitz' Fitzgerald, a former Special Forces soldier who becomes a one-man war against the foreign corporation seizing his neighbors' land.</li></ul></div><p>The makers of <b>Ghost Soldier</b> have released the official trailer, unveiled October 14, 2026.</p><p>Jim Caviezel stars as Henry 'Fitz' Fitzgerald, with Olivia Thirlby, Beau Knapp, Garret Dillahunt and Shea Whigham. William Eubank directs, from a script by Chris Papasadero. The action-thriller opens in US theaters on Veterans Day, November 11, 2026.</p>\n\n<youtube>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UKaWzMf9Ybc</youtube>\n<p>For diaspora audiences tracking the film's US release, the trailer is the first real look at what's headed to theaters.</p><div class=\"vdc\"><div class=\"vdc-glow\"></div><div class=\"vdc-title\">Film information</div><div class=\"vdc-grid\"><div class=\"vdc-stat\"><div class=\"vdc-stat-val\">William Eubank</div><div class=\"vdc-stat-lbl\">Director</div></div><div class=\"vdc-stat\"><div class=\"vdc-stat-val\">Movie</div><div class=\"vdc-stat-lbl\">Type</div></div><div class=\"vdc-stat\"><div class=\"vdc-stat-val\">Nov 11, 2026</div><div class=\"vdc-stat-lbl\">Release</div></div></div><div class=\"vdc-cast\"><div class=\"vdc-cast-lbl\">Cast</div><div class=\"cast-strip\"><div class=\"cast-member\"><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/15/Jim_Caviezel_at_the_2013_SDCC.jpg/330px-Jim_Caviezel_at_the_2013_SDCC.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=api&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" alt=\"Jim Caviezel\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"